{
  "resources": {
    "vehicle_positions": {
      "canonical": "/v3/positions",
      "deprecated_aliases": ["/v1/locations", "/v2/pings"]
    },
    "trip_history": {
      "canonical": "/v3/trips",
      "deprecated_aliases": ["/v1/journeys"],
      "not": "/v2/routes (planned routes)"
    },
    "sensor_frames": {
      "canonical": "/v3/sensor-frames",
      "deprecated_aliases": ["/v2/sensors"]
    },
    "geofence_events": {
      "canonical": "/v3/geofence-events",
      "not": "/v3/geofences (definitions)"
    }
  }
}
```

So for sensor_frames:
- canonical_path: "/v3/sensor-frames"
- deprecated_alias: "/v2/sensors" (the deprecated rollup alias)

The user asked for the canonical path and the deprecated rollup alias. The response shows the deprecated_aliases is an array with one entry: ["/v2/sensors"].
